3. Scientific models and literature
-----------------------------------
- Goldak double-ellipsoid heat source:
  M. Goldak, A. Chakravarti, M. Bibby, "A new finite element model for
  welding heat sources", Metallurgical Transactions B 17B (1986) 187-193.

- P48 arc/droplet energy-partition heat source:
  Progress in Additive Manufacturing 1 (2025) 10:11647.

- CAS-DEDD-IMEEN26 external benchmark (AlSi10Mg DED validation case),
  Ansys Academic Program / TU Wien, 2026.

- Kirkaldy-Venugopalan nucleation kinetics; Koistinen-Marburger martensite
  start; JMAK (Johnson-Mehl-Avrami-Kolmogorov) transformation kinetics;
  Hall-Petch strengthening; WRC-1992 constitution diagram; IIW carbon
  equivalent. All are published empirical relations used in
  core/multimaterial/alloy_metallurgy.py.


